WEBVTT

NOTE Descriptive captions: the video has no speech, only music and on-screen text.

00:00.000 --> 00:04.600
[Music] Predictive typing · French / English — "You type. It guesses." Predict logo.

00:04.600 --> 00:09.000
Step 1: pick Predict like any other language, with Win + Space.

00:09.000 --> 00:13.000
In Notepad, typing "je vais au travail": the next word is predicted in the bar.

00:13.000 --> 00:17.000
"aujourd'" is completed to "aujourd'hui" in one keystroke; context and grammatical agreement guide the suggestions.

00:17.000 --> 00:22.000
Win + ; opens the emoji picker: typing "coeur" inserts the red heart.

00:22.000 --> 00:27.600
Everything it does while you write: word completion, next word, autocorrection, grammatical agreement, learning your words, emoji by name.

00:27.600 --> 00:32.000
Offline. Zero telemetry: your words stay on your PC.

00:32.000 --> 00:34.600
One engine, two systems: Windows and Linux.

00:34.600 --> 00:36.000
Predict — Type faster. Send nothing.
